{"id": "citywide-labor-agreement-bid-terms", "title": "What San Francisco and the building trades agreed to require of bidders", "seconds": 49.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "50d5f7dd245cc24d", "words": 148, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City and construction unions entered their labor agreement in July 2020.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.88, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "could", "bid", "on", "covered", "projects?"], "sub": "Citywide labor agreement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.38, 0.5, 1.05, 1.41, 1.7, 1.89, 2.19, 2.62, 2.74, 3.07, 3.33]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "A qualified firm could bid even without a previous union contract.", "t0": 4.0, "t1": 7.37, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "signed", "kicker": "City and County of San Francisco and signatory labor organizations", "text": "Qualified bidders", "mark": "Qualified bidders"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.62, 0.94, 1.11, 1.4, 1.66, 1.97, 2.05, 2.49, 2.78]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "A nonexempt contractor had to agree to the project terms.", "t0": 7.49, "t1": 10.32, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Terms for covered work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.68, 1.27, 1.39, 1.49, 1.74, 1.83, 1.93, 2.33]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "Certified local firms could claim an exemption until covered payments exceeded five million dollars.", "t0": 10.44, "t1": 15.15, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5 million", "label": "Cumulative payments threshold for certified local firms"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.81, 1.18, 1.36, 1.62, 1.72, 2.19, 2.46, 2.77, 3.26, 3.69, 3.93, 4.2]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The agreement provided for hiring halls and contained a no-strike commitment.", "t0": 15.27, "t1": 18.31, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "faq", "kicker": "San Francisco Office of Labor Standards Enforcement", "text": "Hiring provisions", "mark": "Hiring provisions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.47, 0.87, 0.99, 1.3, 1.6, 1.73, 2.07, 2.14, 2.57]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[3]"], "text": "Two contractors bid on the Mission Branch Library project.", "t0": 18.43, "t1": 21.17, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Mission Branch Library", "heading": "Two submitted prices", "source": "award", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Amoroso", "value": "$23,020,000"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "CLW Builders", "value": "$25,125,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.81, 0.97, 1.04, 1.14, 1.46, 1.75, 2.18]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[3]"], "text": "Amoroso ranked first on best value and received the contract.", "t0": 21.29, "t1": 24.37, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "award", "kicker": "San Francisco Public Works", "text": "Award record", "mark": "Award record"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.56, 0.81, 1.13, 1.27, 1.52, 1.89, 2.05, 2.39, 2.49]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "By December 2023 the City reported 288 assent letters and 49 exemption statements.", "t0": 24.59, "t1": 31.27, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "slides", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller and San Francisco Office of Labor Standards Enforcement", "text": "December 2023 presentation", "mark": "December 2023 presentation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.53, 0.78, 1.55, 1.73, 2.02, 2.47, 2.78, 3.13, 3.74, 4.07, 4.73, 4.99, 5.56, 6.0]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "Four businesses crossed the exemption threshold that year.", "t0": 31.39, "t1": 33.76, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Threshold crossed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.74, 1.03, 1.14, 1.53, 1.93, 2.09]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "The presentation listed 23 awarded projects and reported no work stoppages.", "t0": 33.88, "t1": 38.12, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "23", "label": "Awarded projects in the presentation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.73, 1.07, 1.66, 2.01, 2.57, 2.74, 3.17, 3.34, 3.58]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "No covered project had been completed by the June 2023 evaluation cutoff.", "t0": 38.24, "t1": 42.47, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller", "text": "Evaluation cutoff", "mark": "Evaluation cutoff"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.52, 0.96, 1.08, 1.23, 1.67, 1.81, 1.93, 2.2, 2.5, 3.11, 3.74]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Those records cannot isolate the agreement's effect on construction costs or bidder turnout.", "t0": 42.59, "t1": 46.41, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Effect on bids", "Effect on costs"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.55, 0.87, 1.23, 1.33, 1.74, 2.09, 2.2, 2.74, 3.05, 3.19, 3.44]}, {"scene": "evidence", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 46.53, "t1": 48.68, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Bidding for covered work", "evidence": "What the City measured"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}